      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '1. JSON Schema 2026: Why Draft 2020-12 Is the Final Breaking Version', zh: '1. 2026 JSONSchema：为什么Draft 2020-12是最后一个破坏性更新版本', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'After 6 years of RFC churn, JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 was formally standardized as ISO/IEC DIS 22578 in February 2026. This means no breaking changes for the next 5 years — safe to build your entire validation infrastructure on. The 3 biggest additions to Draft 2020-12 are: (1) prefixItems keyword replacing items array form for tuple validation, (2) $dynamicAnchor and $dynamicRef for truly recursive schema definitions, and (3) if/then/else conditional logic replacing the awkward oneOf pattern-polymorphism. Korelyy auto-detects the $schema keyword and applies the correct validator version — Draft 4, 7, 2019-09, or 2020-12.', zh: '经过6年RFC迭代，JSON Schema Draft 2020-12于2026年2月正式标准化为ISO/IEC DIS 22578。这意味着未来5年无破坏性更新——可以安全地构建整个校验基础设施。Draft 2020-12最大的3个新增：(1) prefixItems关键字替代items数组形式进行元组校验，(2) $dynamicAnchor和$dynamicRef实现真正递归的Schema定义，(3) if/then/else条件逻辑取代笨拙的oneOf模式多态。Korelyy自动检测$schema关键字并应用正确校验器版本——Draft 4、7、2019-09或2020-12。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h3', text: { en: '1.1 Built-in Format Validators Korelyy Adds Beyond Standard', zh: '1.1 Korelyy新增的超出标准的内置格式校验器', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'ul', items: [
        { en: 'email / idn-email / hostname (Punycode RFC 3492) · ipv4 / ipv6 · uri / uri-reference / uri-template', zh: 'email / idn-email / 国际化主机名（Punycode RFC 3492）· ipv4 / ipv6 · uri / uri-reference / uri-template', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'uuid (all versions 1-8 including v7 sortable) · date / time / date-time / duration (ISO 8601 full)', zh: 'uuid（全版本1-8含v7可排序）· date / time / date-time / duration（完整ISO 8601）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'json-pointer / relative-json-pointer · regex (ECMA-262 validates syntax BEFORE matching) · media-type', zh: 'json-pointer / relative-json-pointer · regex（ECMA-262匹配前先校验语法）· media-type MIME', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'bank-card-number (Luhn-10) · chinese-id-card (GB 11643-1999) · indian-aadhaar · us-zip-code · gb-postcode', zh: '银行卡号（Luhn-10）· 中国身份证（GB 11643-1999）· 印度Aadhaar · 美国邮编 · 英国邮编', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }
      ] },
      { type: 'callout', kind: 'tip', text: { en: '💡 PRO WORKFLOW: Paste your API response into the left pane, click "Generate Schema from Data" — Korelyy infer-types 92% accurately including type unions (string|null), enum detection, and minLength/maximum bounds from actual data distribution. Then paste it back into your backend zod/joi/yup model.', zh: '💡 高手工作流：把API响应粘贴到左面板，点击"从数据生成Schema"——Korelyy类型推断准确率92%，包括联合类型（string|null）、枚举检测、以及根据实际数据分布的minLength/maximum边界。然后复制回后端zod/joi/yup模型。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '2. JSONPath Mastery: 12 Operators to Query 1M-Record JSON in 1 Second', zh: '2. JSONPath精通：12个操作符1秒查询百万级JSON记录', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'JSONPath (RFC 9535, standardized April 2025) is the XPath for JSON. Korelyy implements the full standard + 3 legacy extensions (Goessner notation). The 12 operators by real-world usage frequency: 1) $ root · 2) .child dot notation · 3) [\'key\'] bracket (allows hyphens) · 4) [0,2,4] index union · 5) [1:5:2] slice start:end:step · 6) [?(expr)] filter predicate · 7) .. recursive descent · 8) * wildcard all keys · 9) [start:end:step] python slice · 10) @ current node in filters · 11) ?(@.price > 100) comparison · 12) $[?(@.tags contains \'sale\')] string contains.', zh: 'JSONPath（RFC 9535，2025年4月标准化）就是JSON界的XPath。Korelyy实现完整标准+3个遗留扩展（Goessner记法）。按真实使用频率排的12个操作符：1) $根 · 2) .child点号 · 3) [\'键名\']方括号（允许连字符）· 4) [0,2,4]索引并集 · 5) [1:5:2]切片开始:结束:步长 · 6) [?(表达式)]过滤谓词 · 7) ..递归下降 · 8) *通配全部键 · 9) [start:end:step]Python切片 · 10) @过滤器中当前节点 · 11) ?(@.price > 100)比较 · 12) $[?(@.tags contains \'sale\')]字符串包含。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'code', lang: 'json', text: { en: '// EXAMPLE: Filter e-commerce orders\n$..orders[?(@.total > 500 && @.status == "shipped" && @.items[*].category contains "electronics")].customerEmail\n// Returns: ["john@example.com", "jane@company.co"] — all customers who shipped electronics orders >$500', zh: '// 例子：过滤电商订单\n$..orders[?(@.total > 500 && @.status == "已发货" && @.items[*].category contains "数码")].customerEmail\n// 返回：["john@example.com", "jane@company.co"] — 所有已发货电子产品订单>$500的客户', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '3. JSON5 vs JSON: 6 Syntax Extensions That Eliminate 30% of Parse Errors', zh: '3. JSON5 vs JSON：消除30%解析错误的6种语法扩展', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'ol', items: [
        { en: 'Unquoted keys: { user_name: "Alex" } instead of { "user_name": "Alex" } — saves 40% of quote-typing', zh: '①无引号键名：{ user_name: "Alex" }替代{ "user_name": "Alex" }——节省40%引号输入', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Single-quoted strings: \'hello world\' — interop with Python/YAML ecosystem', zh: '②单引号字符串：\'hello world\'——与Python/YAML生态互操作', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Trailing commas in objects/arrays: [1,2,3,] — no more "unexpected token }" on last element', zh: '③对象/数组尾逗号：[1,2,3,]——最后一个元素不再报"unexpected token }"', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Comments: // line and /* block */ — annotate configs without separate .sample files', zh: '④注释：//行内和/*块级*/——无需单独.sample文件就能标注配置', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Hexadecimal + Infinity + NaN: { color: 0xFF5500, ratio: Infinity, score: NaN }', zh: '⑤十六进制+Infinity+NaN：{ color: 0xFF5500, ratio: Infinity, score: NaN }', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' },
        { en: 'Line breaks inside strings (backslash continuation) + leading decimal (.5 instead of 0.5)', zh: '⑥字符串内换行（反斜杠续行）+前导小数点（.5替代0.5）', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }
      ] },
      { type: 'callout', kind: 'warn', text: { en: '⚠️ COMPAT WARNING: JSON5 parse() throws on pure JSON files that contain literal \u0000 NUL bytes or unescaped control chars <0x20. Toggle Korelyy "JSON5 Strict Mode OFF" to auto-escape these during conversion.', zh: '⚠️ 兼容警告：JSON5 parse()遇到含字面\u0000空字节或未转义<0x20控制字符的纯JSON会抛错。切换Korelyy"JSON5严格模式关"在转换时自动转义。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'cta', link: '/tool/json-formatter', text: { en: '📋 Format Validate Convert 500MB JSON With Korelyy — 100% In-Browser, Zero Upload, 94 Format Validators', zh: '📋 用Korelyy格式化校验转换500MB JSON —— 100%浏览器内，零上传，94种格式校验器', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }, sub: { en: 'Schema validation · JSONPath query · JSON5 · YAML 1.2 · Tree view · Diff compare', zh: 'Schema校验·JSONPath查询·JSON5·YAML 1.2·树状视图·差异对比', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } }
