      { type: 'h2', text: { en: '3. Korelyy Timezone Matrix: 48 Cities Simultaneous View + DST Transition Lookup', zh: '3. Korelyy时区矩阵：48城市同步视图+夏令时切换查询', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'p', text: { en: 'The Korelyy timezone converter shows 48 major cities in a responsive grid: UTC, GMT, London (Europe/London observes BST), Paris/Berlin/Rome (CET/CEST with EU DST), Moscow/MSK (permanent DST UTC+3 since 2014), Dubai GST, Mumbai IST, Beijing CST (Asia/Shanghai no DST since 1991), Tokyo JST, Sydney AEST/AEDT with AU DST (opposite hemisphere), New York EST/EDT, Chicago CST/CDT, Denver MST/MDT, LA/LV PST/PDT. Clicking any city sets it as base timezone with conversion computed against all others. The DST lookup feature lets you enter any IANA identifier + year range 1970–2100 → Korelyy computes all clock-forward / clock-back transitions with exact ISO timestamp and offset delta. Historical DST data verified against 12 government gazette sources.', zh: 'Korelyy时区转换器响应式网格显示48个主要城市：UTC、GMT、London（Europe/London用BST）、Paris/Berlin/Rome（CET/CEST带欧盟夏令时）、Moscow/MSK（2014起永久夏令时UTC+3）、Dubai GST、Mumbai IST、Beijing CST（Asia/Shanghai 1991年起无夏令时）、Tokyo JST、Sydney AEST/AEDT带澳洲夏令时（半球相反）、New York EST/EDT、Chicago CST/CDT、Denver MST/MDT、LA/LV PST/PDT。点击任意城市设为基准时区，所有其他城市自动换算。DST查询功能允许输入任意IANA标识符+年份范围1970-2100→Korelyy计算所有调快调慢切换带精确ISO时间戳和偏移增量。历史DST数据对照12个政府公报来源验证。', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } },
      { type: 'cta', link: '/tool/timestamp-converter', text: { en: '⏰ Convert Any Timestamp Format — 12 Auto-Detected, 48 Cities, 2026a IANA DST Rules', zh: '⏰ 用Korelyy转换任意时间戳格式——自动识别12种、48城市、2026a IANA夏令时规则', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' }, sub: { en: '12 format auto-detect · 48 cities matrix · Y2038 scanner · DST lookup 1970-2100 · Code snippets', zh: '12种格式自动识别·48城市矩阵·Y2038扫描·1970-2100 DST查询·代码片段', es: '', fr: '', hi: '', ar: '' } }
